  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 466677760
    m_Localized: Monopoly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 521203712
    m_Localized: Roll, buy, build and trade your way around the world. Up to four players at one screen, computer opponents on three levels, and six ways to play.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398016
    m_Localized: Classic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398017
    m_Localized: 'The World Tour edition: a mint board on a wooden table, pewter figures and white title deeds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398018
    m_Localized: Galactic Trade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398019
    m_Localized: 'A space station trading floor: a dark board with glowing lanes, holographic cards, spacecraft tokens and domes and towers with lit windows.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398020
    m_Localized: WORLD TOUR EDITION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398021
    m_Localized: GALACTIC TRADE EDITION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398022
    m_Localized: Speed Die
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398023
    m_Localized: Quick Deal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398024
    m_Localized: House Rules
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398025
    m_Localized: Tycoon Rush
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398026
    m_Localized: Custom Rules
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398027
    m_Localized: The full game. Buy, build, bankrupt everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398028
    m_Localized: 'The Mega Edition''s red die: bus rides and Mr. Monopoly.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398029
    m_Localized: 'The short game: two deeds each, hotels at three houses.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398030
    m_Localized: Free Parking jackpot, double GO, party cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398031
    m_Localized: 20 rounds, the speed die, $2,000 to start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398032
    m_Localized: Your own mix, set in House Rules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398033
    m_Localized: 'The official rules. Buy what you land on or it goes to auction. Collect rent, doubled on a full color set, and build evenly: the bank has 32 houses and 12 hotels. Mortgage to raise cash, trade to complete sets. Doubles roll again, three doubles go to jail. The last player standing wins.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398034
    m_Localized: Once you have passed GO, the red speed die rolls too. 1 to 3 add to your move. Mr. Monopoly moves you on to the next property for sale (or the next rent you owe). The bus lets you move by either die or both. Triples move you anywhere you like!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398035
    m_Localized: The official short game. Everyone is dealt two title deeds (and pays for them), hotels need only three houses, and the game ends at the second bankruptcy. Then the richest player wins, counting cash, property and buildings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398036
    m_Localized: 'The table favourites. Taxes and fines go into a Free Parking jackpot, landing right on GO pays double, party cards (Robin Hood, free houses, a charity gala) join the decks, and there are no auctions: what nobody buys stays with the bank.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398037
    m_Localized: 'A race against the clock: twenty rounds with the speed die and $2,000 each to start. When time is up the player with the highest net worth wins, so buy early and build fast.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398038
    m_Localized: 'Play with your own rules: turn on custom rules in House Rules on the main menu and choose the starting cash, a round limit, dealt title deeds, auctions, the speed die, the jackpot, double GO, no rent from jail and the party cards.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398039
    m_Localized: '1 star: beat the computer.  2 stars: beat three computer players.  3 stars: beat three hard ones.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
