    m_Localized: Shinjuku
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398136
    m_Localized: Fifth Avenue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398137
    m_Localized: Luxury Tax
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398138
    m_Localized: "Champs-\xC9lys\xE9es"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398139
    m_Localized: Advance to GO. Collect $200.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398140
    m_Localized: "Go shopping on the Champs-\xC9lys\xE9es. Advance there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398141
    m_Localized: Advance to Ginza. If you pass GO, collect $200.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398142
    m_Localized: Advance to Lapa. If you pass GO, collect $200.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398143
    m_Localized: Catch a train at Grand Central. If you pass GO, collect $200.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398144
    m_Localized: All aboard! Advance to the nearest station. If it is owned, pay the owner twice the rent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398145
    m_Localized: Advance to the nearest utility. If it is owned, roll the dice and pay the owner ten times the roll.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398146
    m_Localized: Your travel blog goes viral. Collect $50.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398147
    m_Localized: Get Out of Jail Free. Keep this card until you need it, or trade it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398148
    m_Localized: Wrong turn! Go back three spaces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398149
    m_Localized: Go to Jail. Move directly to Jail. Do not pass GO, do not collect $200.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398150
    m_Localized: Your hotels need a makeover. Pay $25 for each house and $100 for each hotel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398151
    m_Localized: Speeding ticket on the autobahn. Pay $15.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398152
    m_Localized: You treat the whole tour group to dinner. Pay each player $50.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398153
    m_Localized: Your travel savings mature. Collect $150.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398154
    m_Localized: Hitch a ride to Free Parking. Advance there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398155
    m_Localized: Robin Hood! The richest player pays you $100.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398156
    m_Localized: Tailwind! Move forward five spaces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398157
    m_Localized: The bank made a mistake in your favor. Collect $200.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398158
    m_Localized: Travel insurance co-payment. Pay $50.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398159
    m_Localized: You sell your holiday photos. Collect $50.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398160
    m_Localized: Your holiday fund matures. Collect $100.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398161
    m_Localized: Tax refund. Collect $20.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398162
    m_Localized: It is your birthday! Collect $10 from every player.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398163
    m_Localized: Your life insurance matures. Collect $100.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398164
    m_Localized: Hospital bill after a ski trip. Pay $100.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398165
    m_Localized: Language school fees. Pay $50.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398166
    m_Localized: You guide a city tour. Collect a $25 fee.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398167
    m_Localized: Street repairs. Pay $40 for each house and $115 for each hotel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398168
    m_Localized: You win second prize in a sandcastle contest. Collect $10.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398169
    m_Localized: You inherit $100 from a long lost aunt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398170
    m_Localized: Charity gala! Every player pays $25 into the Free Parking pot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398171
    m_Localized: Free upgrade! A free house on your cheapest complete set.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398172
    m_Localized: Time is up! The richest player wins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398173
    m_Localized: Three doubles in a row! Go to jail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398174
    m_Localized: 'Mr. Monopoly: on to the next property for sale!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398175
    m_Localized: 'Mr. Monopoly: everything is sold, on to the next rent!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398176
    m_Localized: Mr. Monopoly has nowhere to go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398177
    m_Localized: No buildings, nothing to repair.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398178
    m_Localized: No complete set to build on. Better luck next time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398179
    m_Localized: 'The richest player pays up: {0}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398180
    m_Localized: Seat at least two players.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398181
    m_Localized: Every player needs a different token.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398182
    m_Localized: The trade is empty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398183
    m_Localized: Pick another player to trade with.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398184
    m_Localized: Trade on your own turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398185
    m_Localized: A property is listed twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398186
    m_Localized: You can only give your own properties.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398187
    m_Localized: Amounts cannot be negative.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398188
    m_Localized: Not enough Get Out of Jail Free cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398189
    m_Localized: '{0} is out of the game.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398190
    m_Localized: '{0} does not own that property.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398191
    m_Localized: '{0} cannot pay the interest on the mortgaged properties.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398192
    m_Localized: Sell the buildings on the {0} set before trading it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398193
    m_Localized: You only have {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398194
    m_Localized: '{0} only has {1}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398195
    m_Localized: You need {0} for the interest on the mortgaged properties.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398196
    m_Localized: YOUR TURN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398197
    m_Localized: '{0}''S TURN'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398198
    m_Localized: FINAL ROUND!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398199
    m_Localized: DOUBLES!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
